{"ID":"20250328170608-yio73vx","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250328170608-yio73vx","title":"CPPS1L2——变量","type":"doc","updated":"20250328181614"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328180352-meiwsaa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250328180352-meiwsaa","updated":"20250328181614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20250328180357-ueygyn4","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328180357-ueygyn4","updated":"20250328181614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"//1、有符号的整形变量 能存储一定范围内的正负数包括0的变量类型\nshort\t\t\t\t\t// -32768~32767\nint\t\t\t\t\t\t// -21亿~21亿\nlong\t\t\t\t\t// Windows: -21亿 ~ 21亿, Unix/Linux: -9223亿亿多 ~ 9223亿亿多\nlong long\t\t\t\t// -9223亿亿多 ~ 9223亿亿多\n//2、无符号的整型变量 能存储一定范围内0和正数的变量类型\nunsigned short\t\t\t// 0~65535\nunsigned\t\t\t\t// 0~42亿多\nunsigned long\t\t\t// Windows: 0~42亿多, Unix/Linux: 0~18446亿亿多\nunsigned long long\t\t// 0~18446亿亿多\n//3、浮点数（小数）\nfloat\t\t\t\t\t// 数字后必须加f声明float，7/8位有效数字\ndouble\t\t\t\t\t// 15~17位有效数字\nlong double\t\t\t\t// Windows(MSVC): 15/17位有效数字, Linux(GCC): 18/19位有效数字，MacOS(Clang): 33~36位有效数字\n//4、特殊类型\nbool\t\t\t\t\t// true 或 false\nchar\t\t\t\t\t// ASCII字符类型，可以当整数用，范围是-128~127\nstd::string\t\t\t\t// 标准库提供的字符串类型，不限定字符编码\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328170608-bab1i4b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250328170608-bab1i4b","updated":"20250328175450"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"变量"}]},{"ID":"20250328171044-z3gafce","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328171044-z3gafce","updated":"20250328171112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"变量是可以变化的容器，变量 就是用来存储各种不同类型数值的一个容器，不同的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"变量类型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 可以存储不同类型的值"}]},{"ID":"20250328171112-i4lg53r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328171112-i4lg53r","updated":"20250328171146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"变量声明基本写法为："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"变量类型 变量名 = 初始值;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，示例："}]},{"ID":"20250328171147-u3ii43u","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328171147-u3ii43u","updated":"20250328171151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"int i = 1;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328171121-xzgixo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328171121-xzgixo2","updated":"20250328171204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其中："}]},{"ID":"20250328171204-67zpthx","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250328171204-67zpthx","updated":"20250328171207"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328171207-l819x8q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20250328171207-l819x8q","updated":"20250328171207"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250328171207-abrnoym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328171207-abrnoym","updated":"20250328171336"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"变量类型 —— 基础变量类型，有 14 种变化"}]},{"ID":"20250328171319-4kpekfl","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250328171319-4kpekfl","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250328171319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250328171250-7cb3z6n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20250328171250-7cb3z6n","updated":"20250328171314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20250328171314-mkf3eez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328171314-