ta":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"string"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 用来存储多个字符的，没有上限，并且它可以用来存储任何字符，因为它采用的编码规则更广泛\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"string"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 类型不能直接使用，它是属于 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的，因此需要引用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 命名空间"}]},{"ID":"20250328175145-az3m4a7","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250328175145-az3m4a7","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250328175339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250328175201-55yqanj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328175201-55yqanj","updated":"20250328175331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意：C++ 的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"std::string"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 类型本身并不强制规定特定的字符编码。它只是按字节存储字符序列，编码由程序员或运行环境决定。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250328175025-gjjhw4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250328175025-gjjhw4p","updated":"20250328175039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"字符串类型的字面量使用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"\u0026quot;\u0026quot;"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 包裹"}]},{"ID":"20250328174905-dk9ti21","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250328174905-dk9ti21","updated":"20250328175601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"std::string str = \"好好学习，天天向上\";\ncout \u003c\u003c str \u003c\u003c endl;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250328175349-3hihqth","Type":"Nod